//// set: cx-c7 — 运行时下标的其它语境：if / assert / 函数实参 / for / while / 归约 / 属性 / 条件 / 维 / 嵌套下标 / 运算
//// model: C70
model C70
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y;
equation
  if n > 2 then y = x[n]; else y = x[1]; end if;
end C70;
//// model: C71
model C71
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y = tt;
equation
  assert(x[n] > 0, "msg");
end C71;
//// model: C72
model C72
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y = tt; algorithm assert(x[n] > 0, "msg");
end C72;
//// model: C73
model C73
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  function f input Real u; output Real v; algorithm v := 2 * u; end f; Real y = f(x[n]);
end C73;
//// model: C74
model C74
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  function f input Real u[:]; output Real v; algorithm v := sum(u); end f; Real y = f(x[2:3]);
end C74;
//// model: C75
model C75
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  function f input Real u[:]; output Real v; algorithm v := sum(u); end f; Real y = f(x[{n, 1}]);
end C75;
//// model: C76
model C76
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y[3];
equation
  for i in 1:3 loop y[i] = x[i] * tt + x[n]; end for;
end C76;
//// model: C77
model C77
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y[2];
equation
  for i in 1:2 loop y[i] = m[i, n]; end for;
end C77;
//// model: C78
model C78
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y[2];
equation
  for i in 1:2 loop y[i] = m[n, i]; end for;
end C78;
//// model: C79
model C79
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y; algorithm y := 0; for i in 1:2 loop for j in 1:3 loop y := y + m[i, j]; end for; end for;
end C79;
//// model: C710
model C710
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y; algorithm y := 0; for i in 1:2 loop y := y + sum(m[i, :]); end for;
end C710;
//// model: C711
model C711
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y; Integer j; algorithm j := 1; y := 0; while j < 3 loop y := y + x[j]; j := j + 1; end while;
end C711;
//// model: C712
model C712
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y[2] = {x[i] * tt for i in 2:3};
end C712;
